  Stages:
  - Text: Very nice - with the Speed Grow on those seeds, you'll be harvesting in only a day or two.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: In the meantime, I'm afraid that personal stash of yours ain't so personal no more. You've gotta sell everything you can get your hands on.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
  - Text: Grab your stash out of the <h1>safe</h> and use the <h1>packaging station</h> to place it in some baggies. You have to package product before it can be sold.
    OnStartTriggers: []
    OnDoneTriggers: []
